  "body_text": "WHY EMDR\n\nPhD Dr. Mehmet OĞUZ\n\nLet me tell you why I chose EMDR therapy and not why you should have EMDR therapy.\n\nThe only reason I went to medical school was to help people unconditionally with the knowledge I had acquired. All doctors start their studies for the same reason and all just want to do something for humanity.\n\nSo why psychiatry?\n\nI am no different from any of you, we are not that different from each other. We live in a now ’that is shaped by our trauma. Thanks to my job, I was a little more lucky to know which perceptions are distorted, and to be even more precise which emotions are distorting my thoughts. But it still wasn't enough.\nThe therapy methods used last too\n...More\n\nWHY EMDR\n\nSERVICES\n\nEMDR İZMİR\n\nHOMEPAGE\nCORPORATE\nSTUDY AREAS\nARTICLES\nBLOG\nVIDEOS\nCONTACT\n\nOur Contact Information\n\nAddress:\nKültür Mah. Talatpaşa bulvarı. Mustafa Bey Apt. No: 1 Daire: 2 Alsancak / İzmir\n\nGsm:\n+90 539 650 11 59\n\nE-Mail:\ninfo@emdrizmir.com\n\n﻿\n\nCopyright © 2021 | EMDR IZMIR All Rights Reserved.\n\niz ajans\n\nRandevu Al\n\nWhatsapp\n\nWHATSAPP\n\nRandevu Al",
